    "A broadcaster switched off is left out of Home and Search; your favourites from it are kept for when it is switched back on." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En radiostation, der er slået fra, vises ikke på Hjem eller i Søg. Dine favoritter fra den gemmes, til den slås til igen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A notification five minutes before a favourite show starts. When the time comes from the weekly pattern rather than today's schedule, it says so." : {
